.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-keyring\-merge \- Merge keys or keyrings into a single keyring
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq keyring merge\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Merge keys or keyrings into a single keyring.
.PP
Multiple versions of the same certificate are merged together.  Where data is replaced (e.g., secret key material), data from the later certificate is preferred.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR=\fIFILE\fR
Write to FILE or stdout if omitted
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.TP
 \fIFILE\fR
Read from FILE or stdin if omitted
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Merge certificate updates.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq keyring merge bob.pgp bob\-updates.pgp
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-keyring\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
